<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan adds MAN to buy list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morgan adds MAN to buy list.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it had added Man AG to its European Fresh Money Buy List.</p>
<p>The brokerage said it dropped Thyssen AG from the priority list.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
